---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Environmental & Social Strategy | Toile Blanche | Saint-Paul de Vence"
  description="Our commitment to net-zero 2030, local engagement, and inclusive practices at Toile Blanche."
>
  <Nav theme="light" />

  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="info-header">
      <div class="info-header-inner">
        <p class="info-eyebrow">Strategy — Net-Zero 2030</p>
        <h1>Environmental &amp; Social Strategy</h1>
        <p class="info-tagline">A declared artwork carries an archival responsibility. Ensuring the Provençal landscape persists for another two centuries is part of the work.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="info-body">
      <div class="info-body-inner">
        <h2>Environmental</h2>

        <h3>Net-Zero 2030</h3>
        <p>We aspire to make Toile Blanche a net-zero emissions property by 2030. Innovative technologies are deployed to guide us toward this goal, and every team member is mobilised in this effort.</p>

        <h3>Water Conservation</h3>
        <p>Rainwater harvesting systems irrigate the gardens. Dual-flush toilets, automatic taps, and water-saving showers are standard throughout the property. Guests are invited to participate in responsible water use during their stay.</p>

        <h3>Energy Efficiency</h3>
        <p>Building insulation has been upgraded for optimal thermal performance. Smart thermostats regulate all spaces automatically.</p>

        <h3>Waste Management</h3>
        <p>Single-use plastics have been eliminated in favour of biodegradable or reusable alternatives. An effective sorting system promotes recycling and composting across the domain.</p>

        <h3>Hotels for Trees</h3>
        <p>Guests may opt out of daily housekeeping. For each day dedicated to this initiative, a tree is planted via the Hotels for Trees programme.</p>

        <h2>Local</h2>

        <h3>Community Engagement</h3>
        <p>We host events that showcase local talent, inviting guests to experience the artistic heritage of Saint-Paul de Vence. We support educational initiatives for both young people and continuing adult education.</p>

        <h3>Local Sourcing</h3>
        <p>We prioritise local, organic, and ethically produced ingredients — both in the kitchen and for property maintenance. Partnerships with local producers guarantee freshness and mutual support.</p>

        <h2>Human</h2>

        <h3>Training</h3>
        <p>Staff receive ongoing training in sustainable best practices. Guests have access to information on environmental footprint and eco-friendly actions they can take during their stay.</p>

        <h3>Inclusive Recruitment</h3>
        <p>Our recruitment strategy favours candidates aligned with our values. We are committed to hiring 5% of our staff from among young people with fewer opportunities in the job market.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  @import '/css/info-page.css';
</style>
